    "causal_summary": "Rename the app-mobile CSS classes to a dash-delimited BEM form (block--element / block--modifier) with a few literal-name fixes, everywhere they appear — markup, dynamic class construction, class directives, scoped and global CSS, and the class-selector consumers in scripts/. State-prefix classes (is-*) stay single-dash. A pure relabel, proven behaviour-preserving by zero-orphan, over-rename scan, token-identity, a before/after screenshot diff, and test:web.",
